WEBVTT

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:34.250
What's that helicopter?

00:05:34.990 --> 00:05:38.290
It's the Speed Wagon Foundation's helicopter.

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:41.290
They're looking for a place to land.

00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:43.790
Speed Wagon Foundation?

00:05:43.930 --> 00:05:47.300
Old man, they're your associates who
are taking care of Mom in Japan?

00:05:47.770 --> 00:05:50.260
Don't tell me we're going on that thing next.

00:05:54.010 --> 00:05:56.570
No, I wish we could hitch a ride...

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:58.610
but they're not Stand users.

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:01.680
Should the enemy attack us,
we'll end up involving them.

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:04.950
Then...why is that helicopter here?

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:08.950
They're bringing in 'backup.'

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:10.380
Backup!?

00:06:25.170 --> 00:06:27.800
He's got bit of a personality problem...

00:06:27.940 --> 00:06:29.930
so it took awhile to bring him in.

00:06:30.180 --> 00:06:31.240
Mr. Joestar...

00:06:31.380 --> 00:06:34.040
it's impossible for him to
accompany us on this trip.

00:06:34.180 --> 00:06:35.980
He cannot be our backup.

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:37.550
Do you know him, Avdol?

00:06:42.530 --> 00:06:43.650
Yes.

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:45.090
Very well.

00:06:50.670 --> 00:06:51.790
Wait a minute.

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:53.160
'Backup' would mean...

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:55.100
he must be a Stand user.

00:06:55.670 --> 00:06:59.470
The Tarot card, 'The Fool'
represents this Stand user.

00:07:09.550 --> 00:07:10.850
'The Fool?'

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:12.850
You mean, like an idiot?

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:16.590
Sounds like his card is not too bright.

00:07:17.430 --> 00:07:19.450
You'll be glad that he's not your enemy.

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:21.190
You'd never beat him!

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:21.890
Wha...

00:07:22.030 --> 00:07:23.660
What did you say, you bastard!?

00:07:24.430 --> 00:07:25.490
Watch your mouth!

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:26.930
Who do you think you are!?

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:28.200
It's the truth.

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:29.240
What's with the hands!?

00:07:29.370 --> 00:07:29.890
It hurts!

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:31.130
Enough, already!

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:33.070
The helicopter is landing.

00:08:05.810 --> 00:08:06.970
Mr. Joestar...

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:08.780
we're glad to see that you're doing well.

00:08:08.910 --> 00:08:10.540
Ah, thank you for your trouble.

00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:11.670
I appreciate it.

00:08:12.850 --> 00:08:14.320
Which guy...

00:08:14.450 --> 00:08:15.680
is the Stand user?

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:35.470
Which guy is it, I'm asking you.

00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:36.770
Is it you?

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:39.000
No, it's not us.

00:08:39.380 --> 00:08:41.210
He's in the backseat.

00:08:52.450 --> 00:08:54.220
Seems like...no one's there.

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:56.150
No, he's there.

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:01.990
Hey, hey, what do you mean he's there?

00:09:02.630 --> 00:09:04.360
Is he like, an incredibly tiny guy?

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:05.900
Come on out, hey!

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:07.000
Ah! Watch out!

00:09:07.370 --> 00:09:08.430
Be careful...

00:09:08.570 --> 00:09:10.510
he's in a bad mood because
of the rough helicopter ride.

00:09:11.470 --> 00:09:12.630
What's this?

00:09:14.580 --> 00:09:16.410
I told you he has a personality problem.

00:09:16.550 --> 00:09:17.270
Step back!

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:18.140
Polnareff!

00:09:30.390 --> 00:09:30.980
A...

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:32.290
A dog...!?

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:34.920
Old man, this can't be...

00:09:35.060 --> 00:09:38.300
Yes, this dog is 'The Fool' Stand user.

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:43.430
His name is Iggi. He loves to pluck human hair.

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:45.660
It's unknown where he was born.

00:09:45.740 --> 00:09:48.400
The New York dogcatchers
weren't able to capture him...

00:09:48.540 --> 00:09:51.040
but Avdol finally caught him after much effort.

00:09:52.250 --> 00:09:56.690
Oh, yes. While plucking at the hair,
he likes to fart in the person's face.

00:09:57.650 --> 00:09:59.310
Heh. What a vulgar guy.

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:05.150
You damn dog!

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:11.460
I'll teach you a lesson!

00:10:11.600 --> 00:10:12.570
Chariot!

00:10:32.620 --> 00:10:32.990
Th...

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:34.220
This is...!?

00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:42.230
I...I can't cut it!

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:52.340
To put it simply, it's a Stand of sand.

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:55.340
Simplicity is power.

00:10:55.480 --> 00:10:57.000
I might not be able punch him either.

00:10:58.010 --> 00:10:59.310
Hey, help me!

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:01.320
Get rid of this dog!

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:02.010
Ow ow ow...!

00:11:02.820 --> 00:11:04.950
Do you have that favorite stuff of his?

00:11:05.090 --> 00:11:07.020
There's no way we could've
brought him here without it.

00:11:13.130 --> 00:11:13.690
Ah...!

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:14.990
Hide the box!

00:11:15.130 --> 00:11:15.790
Huh?

00:11:25.140 --> 00:11:28.270
He has a weakness for the
coffee-flavored chewing gum.

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:32.450
But he never allows himself to be tamed.

00:11:32.780 --> 00:11:33.940
What a pain.

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:35.710
Take off the darn wrapper before chewing it!

00:11:35.850 --> 00:11:38.980
How can this thing be our backup!?

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:23.430
A dog...

00:12:23.570 --> 00:12:25.030
Stand user...

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:53.130
Here's the food and water you'll need for the trip.

00:12:53.260 --> 00:12:56.060
That contains the medical
supplies, extra clothes and such.

00:12:56.200 --> 00:12:57.220
Thank you.

00:13:00.740 --> 00:13:03.070
Before you leave, I'd like to ask you one thing.

00:13:03.770 --> 00:13:06.070
It's about my daughter...

00:13:09.380 --> 00:13:11.540
How is Holley's condition?

00:13:12.210 --> 00:13:13.580
Give it to me straight.

00:13:14.420 --> 00:13:15.410
Yes...

00:13:15.550 --> 00:13:17.350
I hate to tell you this...

00:13:18.290 --> 00:13:20.120
but I can't say it's very good.

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:22.050
She's rapidly losing her strength...

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:24.560
and her life is still in grave danger.

00:13:24.690 --> 00:13:27.590
According to the prognosis of our
Speed Wagon Foundation physicians...

00:13:27.930 --> 00:13:30.990
at best...she has two more weeks.

00:13:33.270 --> 00:13:34.600
I see...

00:13:37.970 --> 00:13:39.100
Not much time.

00:13:40.810 --> 00:13:42.370
Damn it!

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:01.450
Only two weeks left.

00:14:02.870 --> 00:14:04.360
What a pain.

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:23.190
Now why is this shitty mutt
allowed to be on the seat...

00:15:23.260 --> 00:15:25.290
and we have to be in the bed of the truck!?

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:27.390
I'm so cramped that my butt hurts!

00:15:30.670 --> 00:15:32.830
Let's just wait until the gum loses flavor.

00:15:33.710 --> 00:15:36.800
When it grows stale, we'll lure him in
the back of the truck with a new piece...

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:38.600
then we'll grab the seat while he's distracted.

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:54.780
Damn it!

00:16:02.830 --> 00:16:03.820
Hey, old man...

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:05.500
what's that?

00:16:12.840 --> 00:16:13.830
Earlier...

00:16:13.980 --> 00:16:16.810
the helicopter flew off in that direction.

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:38.190
This is...!

00:16:47.010 --> 00:16:49.410
No trace of attack by weapons...

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:52.640
It's like it just slammed into the ground.

00:16:52.880 --> 00:16:53.820
An accident?

00:16:54.190 --> 00:16:54.980
Be careful!

00:16:55.120 --> 00:16:57.850
It's quite possible this was an
attack by an enemy's Stand.

00:17:16.310 --> 00:17:17.330
Look...

00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:18.900
the pilot...

00:17:19.310 --> 00:17:20.330
he's dead.

00:17:25.280 --> 00:17:26.770
Approach with caution.

00:17:26.850 --> 00:17:28.880
You never know what's lurking.

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:33.280
There are scratch marks on the fuselage.

00:17:44.770 --> 00:17:45.900
It's water!

00:17:52.310 --> 00:17:54.800
So much water...

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:56.170
from his mouth.

00:17:56.650 --> 00:17:59.410
No...from his lungs!

00:18:02.520 --> 00:18:03.750
It can't be!

00:18:05.190 --> 00:18:06.990
He drowned to death...

00:18:08.360 --> 00:18:10.220
in the middle of a desert!

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:11.960
How?

00:18:24.880 --> 00:18:25.500
Hey...

00:18:25.640 --> 00:18:27.740
here's the other one!

00:18:32.320 --> 00:18:33.370
Are you alright?

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:34.820
Hang in there!

00:18:36.050 --> 00:18:37.520
What happened?

00:18:39.020 --> 00:18:39.850
Wa...

00:18:39.990 --> 00:18:41.250
Water...

00:18:43.330 --> 00:18:44.420
Mr. Joestar...

00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:45.490
here you go...

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:47.400
Here, it's water.

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:49.900
Drink it slowly...

00:18:54.140 --> 00:18:55.400
NOOO!

00:18:57.410 --> 00:18:59.880
The water's attacking me!

00:19:09.990 --> 00:19:10.980
An enemy's Stand!

00:19:27.170 --> 00:19:29.440
The enemy's Stand is inside the canteen!

00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:30.440
Shit!

00:19:30.510 --> 00:19:34.950
Why attack these innocent men
from the Speed Wagon Foundation?

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:37.240
Avdol! Did you see what kind of Stand it was?

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:39.110
All I saw was the hand.

00:19:39.250 --> 00:19:41.380
But, it's still is inside the canteen.

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:44.040
I didn't see it leave.

00:19:44.190 --> 00:19:44.980
Jotaro...

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:46.950
search for the enemy's main body!

00:19:48.260 --> 00:19:50.160
I'm searching for it right now.

00:19:59.200 --> 00:20:00.190
No good.

00:20:05.680 --> 00:20:08.270
The main body is not within range of my sight.

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:11.570
He seems to be controlling it from a distance.

00:20:11.720 --> 00:20:13.340
The Stand is small, too.

00:20:14.750 --> 00:20:15.510
Polnareff.

00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:16.350
Huh?

00:20:16.920 --> 00:20:18.390
Attack the canteen.

00:20:19.190 --> 00:20:20.450
You're asking me...!?

00:20:21.130 --> 00:20:25.860
The pilot's entire head just got
sucked into that little canteen!

00:20:27.100 --> 00:20:30.230
Which means, puncturing
holes in that thing may...

00:20:31.340 --> 00:20:32.300
No way!

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:33.770
I think you're closer to it...

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:37.640
why don't you just give it your Emerald Splash?

00:20:37.780 --> 00:20:39.370
I don't want to do it, either.

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:42.940
Don't tell others to do what you don't want to do!

00:20:43.080 --> 00:20:45.780
What kind of twisted mind is that, huh!?

00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:52.880
This is...

00:21:07.340 --> 00:21:08.330
Kakyoin!

00:21:09.210 --> 00:21:10.940
I-It's got Kakyoin!

00:21:12.240 --> 00:21:14.440
Kakyoin!

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:16.340
Kakyoin's eyes...!

00:21:16.910 --> 00:21:17.850
Polnareff!

00:21:17.980 --> 00:21:19.380
Don't panic!

00:21:19.520 --> 00:21:21.510
Use Chariot to protect yourself!

00:21:31.330 --> 00:21:32.690
He's in big trouble!

00:21:54.320 --> 00:21:55.550
What's going on?

00:21:55.920 --> 00:21:58.120
It attacked the pilot's dead body...!?

00:21:58.260 --> 00:21:59.090
That's not it.

00:21:59.160 --> 00:22:00.560
Not the dead body...

00:22:00.690 --> 00:22:01.620
the watch.

00:22:01.760 --> 00:22:04.160
It attacked the alarm sounding from the watch.

00:22:04.400 --> 00:22:05.690
The sound?

00:22:05.830 --> 00:22:07.820
It attacks by detecting sounds.

00:22:20.340 --> 00:22:22.370
Run for the truck, Polnareff!

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:39.620
This is bad!

00:22:41.930 --> 00:22:42.490
Polnareff!

00:22:42.570 --> 00:22:43.260
Hurry!

00:23:00.120 --> 00:23:00.950
Pull them up!

00:23:44.860 --> 00:23:45.990
Not good.

00:23:46.130 --> 00:23:46.820
Yes...

00:23:47.200 --> 00:23:49.220
we can't get off the truck.

00:23:55.010 --> 00:23:57.600
Bastard...how dare he...!

00:24:00.010 --> 00:24:01.240
I'm starting the truck.

00:24:01.310 --> 00:24:02.240
What!?

00:24:04.220 --> 00:24:05.610
Mr. Joestar...

00:24:05.750 --> 00:24:07.270
don't tell me you're running away...

00:24:07.790 --> 00:24:10.750
For now, the priority is to
get away from that Stand!

00:25:04.580 --> 00:25:06.600
They escaped by truck.

00:25:08.250 --> 00:25:09.440
Evidently...

00:25:10.550 --> 00:25:14.950
they now realize that I, N'Dool,
can detect their sounds.

00:25:15.450 --> 00:25:17.320
Although, knowing that...

00:25:17.450 --> 00:25:19.550
won't help them much.

00:25:31.770 --> 00:25:34.100
Since our enemy moves by detecting sounds...

00:25:34.170 --> 00:25:37.940
it can move freely in the
sand without exposing itself.

00:25:38.080 --> 00:25:42.710
Moments before we notice, it can attack us
from behind, or from the soles of our feet.

00:25:42.850 --> 00:25:45.210
On top of that, the main body
can remain at a distance.

00:25:45.350 --> 00:25:46.710
How's Kakyoin doing?

00:25:46.850 --> 00:25:47.840
Not good.

00:25:47.950 --> 00:25:49.680
He's at risk of losing his sight.

00:25:49.820 --> 00:25:51.720
We've got to get him to a doctor right away.

00:26:07.640 --> 00:26:08.400
Polnareff!

00:26:10.870 --> 00:26:12.240
What the..!?

00:26:20.150 --> 00:26:21.480
There's water inside the glove!?

00:26:22.720 --> 00:26:23.820
That dog...

00:26:23.820 --> 00:26:27.550
got out of the truck before my attack.

00:26:29.290 --> 00:26:30.990
It could be a problem...

00:26:31.530 --> 00:26:32.930
but I'll take care of it later.

00:26:35.770 --> 00:26:36.930
Reduce your speed!

00:26:43.810 --> 00:26:44.710
Polnareff!

00:26:48.610 --> 00:26:50.670
Chariot!

00:27:05.100 --> 00:27:06.080
You piece of shit!

00:27:06.230 --> 00:27:07.460
I'll chop you to shreds!

00:27:07.800 --> 00:27:08.730
Wait, Polnareff!

00:27:14.770 --> 00:27:15.530
How's that!?

00:27:22.450 --> 00:27:22.880
Wha...

00:27:23.010 --> 00:27:24.070
What the...!?

00:27:24.210 --> 00:27:25.270
What's going on...

00:27:25.420 --> 00:27:26.310
with this...?

00:27:32.320 --> 00:27:34.220
It combined itself with more water!

00:27:35.330 --> 00:27:37.230
This is bad! He'll suffocate!

00:27:50.040 --> 00:27:50.970
Step back.

00:27:57.280 --> 00:27:59.650
Magician's Red!

00:28:06.460 --> 00:28:08.220
Red Bind!

00:28:13.260 --> 00:28:13.990
Polnareff!

00:28:14.130 --> 00:28:15.190
Spit the water outside!

00:28:25.510 --> 00:28:26.640
Are you alright?

00:28:29.380 --> 00:28:30.970
What do we do now!?

00:28:31.120 --> 00:28:33.910
Unless we find the enemy's main
body, there's nothing we can do!

00:28:41.530 --> 00:28:42.080
Old man!

00:28:42.230 --> 00:28:43.520
The water in the radiator!

00:28:43.660 --> 00:28:44.490
Damn it!

00:30:04.310 --> 00:30:06.240
Everyone...don't move.

00:30:09.010 --> 00:30:11.240
Don't make a sound...

00:30:18.390 --> 00:30:20.820
I know where all the objects fell.

00:30:21.890 --> 00:30:24.660
One by one, I will take you out...

00:30:24.800 --> 00:30:26.420
with precision.

00:30:31.700 --> 00:30:32.960
What a pain...

00:30:34.040 --> 00:30:36.560
Not an easy Stand to deal with.

00:30:37.940 --> 00:30:38.640
But...

00:30:46.280 --> 00:30:48.810
This is getting really interesting.
